      "role": "cite",
      "name": "habeas:coverage",
      "commentary": "This edge-only validation regression deliberately supplies no node\n contents. Its records assert selection dependencies only. Contents\n requires this callback, but reaching it would introduce an unwanted\n content read and fail this guard."
